{"version":1,"content":"<p>英偉達給出的營收展望超過了華爾街的預期，表明需求在行政總裁黃仁勳被迫下台後依然強勁。該公司在周二公佈的財報中預計，第四財季營收將在1300億美元上下浮動3%。分析師此前給出的平均預估為1253億美元。當季毛利率將約為71.5%。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586846.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T23:22:20.443679+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T22:57:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T23:15:31.942444+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T23:15:31.942444+00:00","content_hash":"d1b15231402fd888cdfabce3a2992e99a33ca286c9a30d62f8d98694b5360710","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}